## Summary

This is a draft performance/refactor PR that splits several leaf/runtime surfaces out of `codex-core` so small edits inside core compile less code.

Extracted crates:

- `codex-agent-runtime`: multi-agent registry/mailbox/status plus protocol-only control helpers
- `codex-code-mode-runtime`: V8-backed code-mode runtime and service
- `codex-config-loader`: config layer loading and managed config handling
- `codex-file-watcher`: file watcher implementation
- `codex-js-repl`: JS REPL assets
- `codex-mcp-tool-approval`: MCP approval templates
- `codex-memory-prompts`: memory prompt assets
- `codex-message-history`: message history helpers
- `codex-review`: review format/prompt helpers
- `codex-session-runtime`: turn-local state
- `codex-tool-spec`: tool spec planning adapter

Also moves a large batch of unit tests out of `core/src` into `core/tests/unit` and keeps the production Bazel `core` rlib source set separate from the test source set.

## Build-time notes

Remote devbox warm small-change rebuild for `//codex-rs/core:core`, measured by appending a temporary comment to `core/src/message_history.rs`:

- Before final split pass: `32.583s` Bazel elapsed, `31.73s` critical path, `34.573s` shell wall, `211 files`
- After final split pass: `31.204s` Bazel elapsed, `30.37s` critical path, `33.027s` shell wall, `209 files`

The bigger expected win is that future edits to the extracted surfaces no longer recompile `codex-core` itself.

Core Rust action shape after split:

- `libv8=0`
- `crates_v8=0`
- `code_mode_runtime=0`
- `js_repl_assets_in_core=0`
- `core rlib = 209 files`

## Validation

On remote `dev` mirror:

```bash
cd /tmp/codex-worktrees/codex-core-split-20260417/codex-rs
just bazel-lock-check
bazel build --bes_backend= --bes_results_url= \
  //codex-rs/config-loader:config-loader \
  //codex-rs/session-runtime:session-runtime \
  //codex-rs/tool-spec:tool-spec \
  //codex-rs/agent-runtime:agent-runtime \
  //codex-rs/core:core \
  //codex-rs/core:core-unit-tests-bin
bazel build --bes_backend= --bes_results_url= \
  //codex-rs/config-loader:config-loader \
  //codex-rs/session-runtime:session-runtime \
  //codex-rs/tool-spec:tool-spec \
  //codex-rs/agent-runtime:agent-runtime \
  //codex-rs/core:core \
  //codex-rs/core:core-unit-tests-bin \
  //codex-rs/js-repl:js-repl \
  //codex-rs/code-mode:code-mode \
  //codex-rs/code-mode-runtime:code-mode-runtime \
  //codex-rs/app-server:app-server \
  //codex-rs/file-watcher:file-watcher \
  //codex-rs/mcp-tool-approval:mcp-tool-approval \
  //codex-rs/message-history:message-history \
  //codex-rs/memory-prompts:memory-prompts \
  //codex-rs/review:review
```

All passed.
